ined population >=10)\",\n      \"order\": 12,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verify integration test: test_neglected_tank_breeding_stalls (weak biofilter + overfeeding → chemistry degradation, readiness suppression, worse outcomes than stable control)\",\n      \"order\": 13,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verify bonus tests: test_snapshot_reports_dominant_suppression (32°C → 'temperature') and test_snapshot_uses_runtime_suppression_labels (molt_stress, tan, nitrite labels)\",\n      \"order\": 14,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Run full test suite: 12/12 reproduction_factors tests pass, full workspace passes (0 failures), cargo clippy clean, cargo fmt --check clean\",\n      \"order\": 15,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"cargo test --test reproduction_factors: 12 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored\",\n    \"cargo test (full workspace): all test suites pass with 0 failures across ~600 tests\",\n    \"cargo clippy: Finished dev profile with no warnings\",\n    \"cargo fmt --check: no formatting issues\",\n    \"Reproduction logic in shrimp.rs uses 7-factor multiplicative model: temp_repro_factor, condition_index, (1-instability_index), (1-molt_stress_index), density_repro_factor, tan_repro_factor, no2_repro_factor\",\n    \"All thresholds are named fields in ShrimpRuntimeParams and present in neocaridina_davidi.toml: density_repro_threshold_per_l=10.0, density_repro_half_suppression_per_l=20.0, tan_repro_threshold_mg_n_per_l=1.0, no2_repro_threshold_mg_n_per_l=0.5, egg_drop_instability_threshold=0.5, egg_drop_temp_swing_c=2.0\",\n    \"TankSnapshot.repro_dominant_suppression field populated by dominant_repro_suppression_label() at shrimp.rs:1441, surfaced in every snapshot\",\n    \"EggFailure events carry cause codes: HighAmmonia, HighNitrite, LowOxygen, HighTemperature, LowMinerals, ChemistryIn